WEBVTT

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.120
I've been president for half a year.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.910
I'm used to exploring dungeons now
and can do all sorts of work.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:33.580
I just need to keep it up
and become a proper president!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.580
Perfect!

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.200
Good morning, everyone!

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.450
Huh? What the--?

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.660
<i>Let's dive right into today's letters</i>

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>It's "Personal Advice" and the title is</i>

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.160
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:15.790
<i>Hey, hear me out.</i>
<i>There's something I really wanna say</i>

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:21.000
<i>You've got courage to follow</i>
<i>your dreams which is why I chose you</i>

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.120
<i>Is it a risky bet</i>

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:28.580
<i>Despite no experience,</i>
<i>we jumped right in together</i>

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.040
<i>And this unpredictable story</i>

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.120
<i>Is your creation--</i>
<i>a heart-throbbing innovation</i>

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.580
<i>Quickly! Quickly! Take me along</i>

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.200
<i>On a bittersweet love venture</i>

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:48.000
<i>Ah! Measured not by skill</i>
<i>but by scale and romance</i>

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.040
<i>Hurry! Hurry! Boldly, subtly, show your appeal</i>

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:58.120
<i>Ah! Our meeting was a miracle</i>
<i>that can't be neglected</i>

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:01.700
<i>It's galactic level</i>

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.200
<i>I see. Sounds like you're head over heels.</i>

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.500
<i>Let's tell him, just like battle</i>

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.870
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.250
<i>Everyone, Hurry! Hurry Love! Love!!</i>

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:19.950
"Episode Seven: Interim Report"

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:22.540
Was today a day off?

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:25.870
Huh, President? Good morning!

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.370
"Employee Intro: Guide"

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:33.290
Oh, Guide! Good morning! Where is everyone else?

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:36.290
They headed to a dungeon this morning.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:40.120
They were all itching to test out
the new equipment.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.080
I'm sure they'll be fine with
Yutoria in charge of battle.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:51.290
Probably. I'm just glad to see
they're so enthusiastic.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.040
Are you organizing some paperwork?

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:57.790
That's right. Our interim report is due soon.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:01.830
Our report... It's already that time of year?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:06.040
That's a lot of work for one person.
I can lend you a hand.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.660
Oh, my. You want to help?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.290
I don't have anything else to do.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:16.080
And as president, I think I should
know all sides of the business.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.910
I see! In that case...

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:21.540
...here's the expense paperwork!

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.290
Here's the legal paperwork!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:27.620
Here's the dungeon paperwork!

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:30.950
Could I have you enter all this data for me?

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.790
Th-This much?!
It's heavy enough to kill someone!

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.080
Don't be silly. It's all in a day's work.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.450
Are you for real?!

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:43.330
Yes! Do you think you can handle it?

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:46.660
O-Of course. Leave it to me.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:54.870
U-Um, about this report paperwork...

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.660
Is this all of it?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:02.500
This is about a quarter
of what needs to be done.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:07.620
There isn't too much this time.
Unfortunately, our earnings were slim.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:08.750
Insane!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.750
Is something wrong?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.950
No, I'm just blown away by your speed.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:19.080
I'm actually running behind today.
I'm very sorry.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:23.250
D-Don't be! I'll do my best to keep up with you!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:31.250
Oh! Your numbers here don't add up.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.700
Huh? Where?

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.250
Right here.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:39.080
This amount is carried to next month,
so that's why it's off.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.620
M-My bad.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:46.080
I'm sorry. I'm not helping at all, am I?

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.250
That's not true.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.950
The old man once made the same mistake too.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:53.580
Huh? My dad did?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:02.120
To think we were both this worthless...
I'm sorry over two generations.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:04.160
You don't have to be sorry.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.870
It feels nostalgic with you being his son.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.750
R-Really? That's a bit embarrassing.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.620
Excuse me! I'll take one, please!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.000
Sure! It's 500 gold!

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:30.040
I'm getting hungry.
Would you like to take a break for lunch?

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:35.200
Good idea. I'll go grab something.
How about some one-coin meals?

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:40.660
While that sounds lovely,
why don't we do something different today?

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:41.660
Huh?

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:50.250
Ah! What a nice breeze!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:54.580
Truly! It's such a beautiful day!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.160
Let's take our time and really enjoy lunch!

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.370
I brought enough for you too!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:05.000
It looks good! Are you sure?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.410
Please, help yourself!

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:10.200
In that case, don't mind if I do!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.830
Whoa! It's tasty!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:19.870
I've never had anything like it! What's inside?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:25.000
Chicken and a pinch of numbleaf
as a secret ingredient.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:29.910
Oh, that's why my mouth
is tingling! It's really good!

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.370
I could eat a hundred of these!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:35.250
Do you mean it? In that case...!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.910
I have plenty, so go ahead!

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:42.950
Y-You're so kind.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:50.910
I'm stuffed!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.000
I'm glad you enjoyed it!

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.330
Did you save any room for this?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.250
Huh?!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.750
Coffee.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.290
Oh! Thank you!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.080
Here you are.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:04.410
Thanks.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.410
Mmm, it's good!

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:13.450
It's crisp, yet rich and mature or something.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:17.790
It's a good thing you're our president
and not a food critic.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.620
S-Sorry.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:26.250
By the way, you've worked at
the company for quite a while, right?

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.660
I think it's been about 15 years.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.080
The old man brought me in.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.950
That he did.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:39.040
But it's all thanks to you that
I decided to work at Kibou Company.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.410
Huh? Me?

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:45.580
Yup. You were still young,
so I doubt you remember, though.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.830
What did I do exactly?

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:53.830
While I'd love to sit and chat about it,
we should really head back to work.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.580
Oh, you're right.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:02.000
Hmm. Now I'm curious...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.700
I'll diet... starting tomorrow...

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:12.950
Whew! It's been three hours since lunch,
and there's no end in sight.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:18.870
Hmm? Guide's almost wrapped up...
I'm totally holding her back.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.450
Hey! Anyone there?!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.830
Huh? Who's that?

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:30.080
U-Um, what brings you here today?

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:34.080
Ain't it obvious?!
To get the goods I left in your care!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.200
The goods in our care?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:41.370
Don't play dumb! You know what I left you!
Excalibur!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:47.910
E-Excalibur is a legendary sword.
I think if we had it, I would know.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:50.250
Please wait just a moment.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:56.620
We've never taken upon a request of such nature.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.870
It's not in the records at all.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:02.870
Screw your records!
If you won't give it back, pay up!

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.370
I've got the receipt right here!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.660
Let's see...

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:12.500
This doesn't appear to be our company's stamp.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:16.540
Say what?! What do you call this right here?!

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:22.160
Our company's stamp has a special
pattern on it to prevent forgery.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:25.540
However, it's not present on this receipt.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:28.160
A-Are you saying it's a fake?!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.870
That's correct.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.290
Don't screw with me!

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.830
E-Excuse me!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.500
Eh?! Who the hell are you?!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:40.330
I'm the company president,
so address your concerns to me.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.080
Oh? You've got some guts.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:46.660
In that case, I've got a few
choice words for you.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.540
Let's take this outside.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.660
V-Very well.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:53.160
Not so fast.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.910
G-Guide? I'll handle this.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:10:01.700
It's all right.
Dealing with customers is part of my duties.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.540
Hey, I don't got all day! Hurry it up!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.950
Mister?

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.200
What now?!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.000
Well, you see...

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.790
Mumble mumble mumble...

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.700
Eh?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.660
You heard me.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:17.370
Mumble mumble mumble...

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:19.870
So, are we clear now?

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.580
Y-Yes!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:25.700
S-Sorry! I've made a mistake! Excuse me!

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:26.700
Goodbye!

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:31.790
You sure scared the daylights out of him.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:35.330
Guide, what did you say?

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.160
It's a trade secret.

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:38.040
But--

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.200
It's a trade secret.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.290
I-I see.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.200
Her smile is scary!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.250
I feel like I know someone else like that...

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.500
Achoo!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.450
Did I catch a cold or something?

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.410
Bottoms up!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:03.540
Let's forget that little incident
today with a few drinks!

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:08.910
That's a great idea.
But I appreciate you standing up for me.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:13.870
Oh, please! It's a president's duty
to protect their employees!

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:19.040
You know, no matter how many
years pass, you never change.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:19.700
Huh?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.040
I'm just talking to myself.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:25.370
Anyways, I'm glad you wanted to come.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.200
Nobody else at the company
likes to drink that much.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:33.330
Really? Well I'm honored
to be drinking with you.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:37.540
Oh! But I should warn you
that I hold my liquor well.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.500
Another, please!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.580
Huh? Th-That was fast!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:47.870
I can't fall behind!

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:51.660
I-I'm tatally fine!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:56.500
I promise I'm nut dronk! Let's keep at it!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:12:01.290
You can't even walk in a straight line.
Let's sit you down for a sec.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.000
You need to practice some moderation.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:07.080
You can be serious to a fault.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.620
Nah, dat's not true!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.790
You're the one who werks way too hard!

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.330
You slayed that mountain of paper.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:20.410
I've learned the most efficient
way to do it, that's all.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:27.120
Anyways, Guide... What'd I do when I was little?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.040
You really wanna know?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.580
Yeah...

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:34.120
It was back when you were seven years old.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:38.290
The old man and I were working
in the office, and then...

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.290
President?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.950
This reminds me of back then.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:01.250
I guess we'll save the memories for another day.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:04.910
Thanks for your hard work today.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:13.410
Whew! The report's out of the way,
and everyone's bonus is paid.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:18.160
Now all that's left is to get enough
kirakuri to summon the goddess...

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.040
...and ask where my dad is.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:24.080
Huh? Did you forget something?

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.870
Nope! I just wanna ask you a favor.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.540
"Employee Intro: Akari"

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.000
A favor?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.450
Do you have any plans tomorrow?

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:37.750
It's a day off, so none except
for cleaning the house.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.910
In that case, can you help me out
with something?

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.870
Sure. That's fine with me.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:46.790
It's settled then! Meet me at the port at noon!

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:49.750
And don't be late!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:53.290
What's going on? Why would Akari ask me?

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:02.120
Am I here at the wrong time?

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:04.450
President!

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:07.700
Sorry! I think my clock died!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.830
It's fine. I'm glad it was nothing.
So, about today...

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.080
I want you to come shopping!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.120
Shopping? For what?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.540
You'll find out soon enough! This way!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:30.040
I haven't been here in a while,
but it sure is hopping!

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:34.540
C'mon, President!
You'll get lost if you space out!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.250
What are we shopping for anyways?

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:40.830
Akari?

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.750
I wanna buy a present.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.200
A present?

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:49.120
Yeah. And it's for a guy,
so I wanted to ask your opinion.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.700
That makes sense. Are they an adventurer?

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.910
Well, I suppose so.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:58.160
Then how about some weapons or armor?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.700
Weapons or armor, huh?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.500
Not a bad idea!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.000
There sure is a lot of stuff!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:12.410
Swords, spears, axes, staves...
And armor from head to toe!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.790
What would be good though?

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:16.500
Hey, President!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.290
Come and try this on!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:21.500
Me?! I'm not really a fighter though.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:25.750
I just wanna see it on someone!
It might even look good on you!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:28.250
Y-You think?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.250
Okay!

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:31.200
Well?

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.290
It feels so wrong.

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:38.450
It's like the armor's wearing you.
Like a new employee wearing a tux.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:41.450
And here I thought you'd look good in it!

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:43.080
Do you even lift?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.120
U-Uh, that's...

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:49.330
I figured as much.
For a lazy president like you...

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.830
This might work!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.120
That's one risky bikini.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:58.540
You're slender like a girl, so it's perfect!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.160
I can't deny it...

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:08.410
We checked out a bunch,
but I guess weapons and armor are out.

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:13.080
If he's an adventurer,
I'm sure he has his preferences anyways.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:16.790
Ugh, what now? What do I get?

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.290
What are you eating?

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.910
Hmm? It's just a kebab.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:26.160
I've seen that wagon around
and I've been dying to try one!

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:30.910
Don't worry, I bought one for you too!
It's super yummy!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:34.750
Oh, thanks! I can't wait to try it!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.500
Mmm! Delicious!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:41.410
Right?! Can I try a bite of yours?

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:42.830
Huh? Mine?

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:47.290
Because they're different flavors!
You can try mine too!

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:49.250
But that's an indirect...

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.410
Who cares? Here!

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.500
It's chow time!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:57.450
Mmm! It's super yummy too!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:58.870
She ate it!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.660
What's wrong? Try a bite of mine!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.750
O-Okay... Right...

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.700
Isn't that good too?!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.790
Between spicy mayo and savory sauce,
I don't know which is better!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:17.120
Huh? Am I the only one thinking about it?

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.620
Whoa!

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:19.750
Huh? What?

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:25.410
I thought these were sold out!

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:29.620
Huh? Isn't that one of those cute carropan maju?

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:35.330
I-I want it! But then I'll be out of money!
But I want it!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:38.000
You've got a good eye there, missy.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.450
That's limited-edition.
Don't let this chance slip away!

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:43.000
Huh?

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.120
Eh? Gah!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:52.450
Should I give in and buy it or resist?!
What should I do?!

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:58.290
Resist it is!

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:00.750
Akari, I think it's fake anyways.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.750
The carropan's holding a radish, not a carrot!

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.080
Huh? Really?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:09.870
J-Just look at the time!
I've gotta close up shop! Come again!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.450
It's back to present hunting.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.000
I know! How about an accessory?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.160
Accessory?

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:26.290
Yup! Lot of 'em have magical powers,
so they're great for adventurers!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.580
That might work!
That's not a bad idea, coming from you!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.120
Okay, let's go!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.160
That "coming from you" was unnecessary.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:41.660
Dang, that's pricey!
Isn't there one too many zeros?

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.410
Accessories can be pricey
since they're easy to use.

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:51.250
Argh! I'm not stopping the search!
I gave up the carropan for this!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.910
It was a fake, though.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:19:00.080
Um, this bag of pervert accusation
prevention costs... 150,000 gold?!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:05.250
This watch is the right price,
but it only keeps you from losing things.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:10.750
These shoes reduce foot swelling?
That's just a regular health product.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:15.200
This is making my head spin.
So? What do you think is best?

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.000
Me? If I had to choose...

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:21.950
A tie bar?

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:27.660
Yup. It's a nice design for the price,
and it boosts mental focus.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:29.870
I'd like this if it was me.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.620
Yeah?

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.870
It's settled! I'll get that!

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.200
Huh? Really?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.500
Yup!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.080
Excuse me! I want this!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.540
Is she sick of looking?

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:46.500
Wrap it up, please! And make it look fabulous!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:52.790
Then again, she looks rather pleased with it.
Who's it for, anyways?

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.580
Oh, I see!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:02.040
Thanks a bunch!
I couldn't have picked it without you!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:06.120
You're welcome.
I'm sure Rivar will just love it.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.830
Huh? Why would you think him?

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:14.290
Because who else but Rivar
is a guy adventurer close to you?

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:17.910
We owe him for telling us
about the weird dungeon.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:22.410
All he does is give me a hard time.
He's never getting anything.

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:25.120
Not even a single tissue from me.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.290
Then, who's the present for?

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.040
Th-That's...

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:36.910
Huh?

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.080
Here.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.540
What?

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:42.700
The present is... for you.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.750
For me? Why?

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:51.000
You worked hard to claim the legacy
and it made my bonus go up too.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:54.790
But that's my job.
I've screwed up more often than not.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:21:02.120
It's true, you were unreliable.
At first, I didn't trust you much.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:07.160
But then we explored dungeons
and overcame obstacles together.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.620
Not to mention you saved me.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.080
Now, you're precious to me.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.540
Precious to you?

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:19.200
Don't take it the wrong way!
I mean, as a coworker!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.200
Yeah, I get it.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:27.620
Anyways, I still think you're unreliable.
But you're a boss I'm proud of.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.450
Akari...

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.080
So, this represents my feelings.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:36.370
Feel free to wear it if you like.
It's no big deal.

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:38.660
Thanks. I'll cherish it.

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.160
Good, perfect!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.950
By the way, there's one more favor
I have to ask...

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.080
What?

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.410
Well...

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.410
Yeah?

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:54.660
Actually...

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:55.660
Yeah?

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:04.160
Can I borrow money?!

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:07.790
I spent too much
and can't afford the ferry home!

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:13.540
S-Sorry! I didn't bring my wallet today!

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:16.160
Wha--?! You're kidding!

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.250
<i>Looking way up into the night sky</i>

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:47.870
<i>A pretty jewel caught my eye</i>

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:52.200
<i>Clear skies tomorrow sure would be nice</i>

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>Now, make a wish upon a star</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.410
<i>Lazily</i>

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.250
<i>Today comes to a close</i>

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:05.620
<i>Dead tired and worn out</i>

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:12.120
<i>Good work</i>
<i>Let's do our best again tomorrow</i>

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>Goodnight</i>

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>Every day is sparkling</i>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>Just like a box of jewels (sparkling)</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:23.620
<i>And so brilliant</i>

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:25.830
<i>Any work undone</i>

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:30.410
<i>We'll leave for dreamland (sleep tight)</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.910
<i>Let's embark on adventure</i>

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>So sleep soundly tonight</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:43.450
<i>And meet up with me in our dreams</i>

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:46.540
<i>Sleep tight</i>
